OL,3,GNEWSAIf I had three kidneys I would
OL,4,Adonate again, says GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired GP who gave a kidney to a
OL,7,Fstranger has said she would repeat the
OL,8,Fact if she "had a third kidney", after
OL,9,Ftaking part in a charity's new campaign
OL,10,Ffilm.
OL,12,FSelma Asghar, from Cambridge, underwent
OL,13,Fsurgery in 2024 to donate a kidney to
OL,14,Fan unknown person on the transplant
OL,15,Fwaiting list.
OL,17,FAsghar said she was inspired to donate
OL,18,Fafter reading about someone doing the
OL,19,Fsame in their 80s.
