OL,3,GNEWSAIf I had three kidneys I would
OL,4,Adonate again, says GP
OL,5,
OL,6,F"At that time I was in my late 50s and
OL,7,FI thought 'Well that's it, then,
OL,8,Fthere's no age limit to this' [and] my
OL,9,Fmind was made up," she explained.
